# Local settings for `pnpm dev`. pnpm dev works without this file. To change
# a value, copy this file to .dev.vars, which git ignores.
#
# Every variable the app reads is listed here with a safe local default.
# Staging and production will get theirs from the GitHub environment when
# they deploy (#32). Secrets go up with `wrangler secret put`.

# The environment the Worker runs as: development, staging, or production.
# /healthz reports it.
ENVIRONMENT=development

# GitHub's REST and GraphQL API, and github.com itself for sign-in. The
# defaults point at the GitHub fake that `pnpm dev` starts. Left empty, the
# app calls https://api.github.com and https://github.com, which is what a
# deploy gets when its GitHub environment doesn't set them.
GH_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8944/api
GH_WEB_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8944
